iv><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><div class="language-go line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="prismjs" data-ext="go"><pre v-pre><code class="language-go"><span class="line"><span class="token comment">// internal/campaign/engine/conditions/expression.go</span></span>
