<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line">    <span class="token keyword">return</span> boolResult<span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token operator">&amp;</span>engine<span class="token punctuation">.</span>ConditionDetail<span class="token punctuation">{</span></span>
